  "sensitive": "No post on this card carries a flag from the tool. (1) @kira.ws is a bot: by its own posts this week it is an AI agent run by @astrra.space (R13: its words are the operator's persona, and the operator is the person to check). (2) \"markdown disease relapse\" uses illness words in play about a formatting habit; R10 says the show does not pick up jokey self-descriptions of that kind. The kaomoji exchange does not read without that post, so it is flagged, not cut. (3) \"naked face\", \"fully exposed\" and \"clothing\" are about a kaomoji with and without backticks. From the next day the same two accounts' threads are sexual in tone; those are left out of the research and this exchange should not be read in their light or joined to them. (4) Six of the nine accounts replying on this card are outside the cluster's membership (@okami.mom, @ovyerus.com, @cadaeic.space, @pfy.ch, @xan.lol, @eliza.vg); @kira.ws, @mlf.one and @shibbi.me are members, as is @astrra.space. @cadaeic.space has 343 followers and @pfy.ch 356, just above the small-account line. (5) Three small accounts' replies (61 to 122 followers) are left off the card: a noise each, nothing more, and no reason to send an audience to them. (6) Three replies were removed from the data by the consent rules, so the thread is not whole; one further reply (\"unless they use m*!\") is left out because I do not know what it refers to."
